    "",
    "The lineage backs it up: the Romulan K-series are Klingon hulls in Romulan service. KR is the",
    "D6, K7R the D7, and this is the C9 dreadnought (klingon/c9.json, Y167, 205 BPV) at Y172 and",
    "269 with the refit and Romulan fittings.",
    "",
    "Every other hull in the data is a base plus named variants, so the shape here looks like an",
    "omission and is not one. It was queried on 2026-10-12 while surveying the Advanced Missions",
    "SSD book, which lists a K9R at page 97 — that entry is the KLINGON-service ship, not a",
    "Romulan one."
